      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: I need to record my POV without capturing the UI layer.\n\nAs far as I know avatar cameras can't directly access headTrackingData and will rely on the avatar head bone. This is sadly not sufficient for me.\n\nPlease correct me if my assumptions are wrong!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
