  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-09-12T17:16:47.024Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'd like to be able to change the layermask of the steadycam so I can hide the UI layer when recording my POV. This is helpful for adding markers that only I can see while recording, but won't show up in the video. For example I'd put objects on the UI layer when making the world so I can know exactly where things need to be.",
